# One pattern per line, matched case-insensitively against tracked file
# contents and tracked filenames. '#' starts a comment.
#
# Put here anything that must never become public: a predecessor project name,
# your real name, an email domain, hostnames, home-directory paths, and any
# third-party brand you do not want as this project's public interface.
#
# In CI this list comes from the LEAK_PATTERNS repository secret instead, so
# the list itself never enters the repository.

example-old-project-name
example-hostname
/home/example
